      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹67.57 (vs ₹32.31 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹67.57 (up from ₹32.31 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹3.42b (up 9.5% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹556.4m (up 102% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 16% (up from 8.8% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 26% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 4% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
